GAL16V8
ROM_YM

NC HALT RW A0 A11 A12 A13 A14 A15 GND
PHI2 NC NC NC NC NC ROMCE BC1 BDIR VCC

BDIR = /A15 * /A14 * /A13 * /A12 * A11 * /RW * HALT * PHI2
BC1 = /A15 * /A14 * /A13 * /A12 * A11 * /RW * /A0 * HALT * PHI2
/ROMCE = A15 * RW + A14 * RW

DESCRIPTION

Atari 7800 YM2149 Address Decoder (28-pin board, ATF16V8B).
BDIR directly drives both YM2149 Pin 27 (BDIR) and 74HCT373 Pin 11 (LE).
Cartridge PHI2 directly drives YM2149 Pin 22 (CLK).
ROM enabled for reads at $4000-$FFFF (48KB with 27C512, JP1=R, JP2=R).
  $4000-$7FFF reads  -> ROM (16KB window, A14=1, A15=0)
  $8000-$FFFF reads  -> ROM (32KB window, A15=1)
  $0800-$0801 writes -> YM2149 (RW=0, ROM_CE not asserted; A15=A14=A13=A12=0, A11=1)
Supports 16KB (27C128), 32KB (27C256), and 48KB (27C512) via JP1/JP2.
